    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "A plant nursery bases the price of a hedge on its height (in cm).\n\nThe regression equation for this situation is $P = 0.85h + 4.2$, where $P$ is the price in dollars and $h$ is the height in cm.\n\nIdentify the independent variable and dependent variable.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "Independent: height in cm. Dependent: price in dollars.",
      "worked": "The independent variable is height, $h$, in cm. The dependent variable is the price, $P$, in dollars, because the price depends on the height of the hedge.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
